meta {
  name: Update Driver Status
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

put {
  url: {{base_url}}/drivers/{{driver_id}}/status
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "Available"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Update Driver Status

  Changes the availability status of a driver (Available, Busy, Offline).

  ### URL Parameters
  - `driver_id`: The ID of the driver to update

  ### Request Body
  - `status`: New status for the driver
    - `"Available"`: Driver is ready for assignments
    - `"Busy"`: Driver is currently on a trip
    - `"Offline"`: Driver is not available

  ### Response
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Status updated"
  }
  ```

  ### Test Script
  ```javascript
  if (res.getStatus() === 200) {
    console.log('✅ Driver status updated successfully');
  } else {
    console.log('❌ Failed to update driver status');
  }
  ```

  ### Common Workflows
  1. **Start Trip**: Set status to "Busy"
  2. **Complete Trip**: Set status to "Available"
  3. **Driver Offline**: Set status to "Offline"
}